    text_layout_noto_sans_sc_variable_blank_raster_2026_11_05, 1024, "2026-11-05 rel100-r2: FOUND during browser_renderer residual fixes: Draw IR fast-lane text carries font identity sha256=a3041811...f0da (Noto Sans SC wght variable); select_font_identity + staging succeed (2 quads, cpu:success) but the rasterized atlas is fully zero-alpha at 16px — silent no-ink text paint. Engine2D now refuses transparent-atlas batches (typed reason) and degrades to bitmap, so the user-visible symptom is fixed; the rasterizer root cause in nogc_sync_mut/text_layout remains. Probe: selected=true ok=true nonwhite=0."

